{"server":"tw","storyId":"act35side_level_act35side_06_beg","groupId":"act35side","stageId":"act35side_06","title":"過往雲煙","storyCode":"AS-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a86d17beab38493141ee981acd6a1bd203a0ba1699cd3bf3feecef5655f56a7a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g8_sargondeluxeroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"室內，空氣因為酷暑而變得沉悶，女孩坐在桌前，一邊翻著厚厚的資料，一邊擦拭從額角流下的汗水。\n背後響起了腳步聲，她知道有人進來了，但卻懶得回頭看。\n桌子上有扁桃仁，他會自己拿的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你在看什麼書啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，下午太陽這麼好，出去玩啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你不會打算鑽在這堆落灰的莎草紙卷裡一輩子吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我去請求父親了，他說他會考慮讓我成為黃金之城的史官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，做個帕夏也很好，放棄吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了！你別吵我了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩猛地回過頭，卻發現背後空無一人。\n只有她擲出的書卷，孤零零地躺在地板上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"佩佩，你在嗎？快開門！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在，請進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我傳了那麼多訊息到你的通訊器，你為什麼不回？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把通訊器關掉，在這裡看了一晚上的書，發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，昨夜發生那麼多事情，難不成你在這裡一無所知嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個悶著頭來做事的個性真的是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我也不知道該說什麼了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接聽吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電台廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"米城內多個區域發生緊急事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電台廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有大量金屬構裝的人偶走上街頭，從居民家中搶奪大量寶石後離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電台廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"據悉，已有眾多市民向城市護衛隊報告，護衛隊隊長表示正在追查中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金屬人偶……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電台廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"據目擊者透露，他曾於昨夜目睹這些金屬構裝人偶從本市博物館中逃出……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個……我想說的，她都說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿娜特說，博物館的工作人員跟隨著構裝體的蹤跡，最後找到了大巴扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是祖拜爾做的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們懷疑是這樣，但是沒人看到他，你和他相處時間最久，你能去找找看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，我這就過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你和阿娜特呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為博物館的管理人員，我們總得將文物盡數找回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們打算去街上看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一有消息我就通知你們，再會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電台廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，慢著，本台插播一條急訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電台廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有市民發現家中取水器內流出的水變得渾濁，其中摻雜大量泥沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電台廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"護衛隊方面稱，他們正在緊急組織人力檢查城市老地下水通道，由於通道情況複雜，可能仍然需要時間……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這又是什麼情況？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……某人已經跟我說過這裡的故事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寶石繁榮了大巴扎，與香料、綢緞、工藝品一同源源不斷地為這裡帶來財富。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藉由寶石交易所，藉由這些有著特殊源石迴路的寶石，米納特哈瑪儀成為鑲嵌在沙海中的一顆晨星……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古老的建築不斷淌下黃沙，人們推開窗戶或走出大門，驚異地看向自己祖祖輩輩生活的房屋，繼而看向站在街道中央的祖拜爾。\n但祖拜爾卻彷彿沒有注意到他們。\n他俯身從黃沙中拾起一枚首飾，螺旋形金屬框架正中的寶石在日光下熠熠生輝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜爾先生，您提起的壁畫就在前方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的外祖父曾說過，牆上的圖畫描繪了古薩爾貢人的生活，記錄著米納特哈瑪儀的誕生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“即便河水乾涸，城市被掩埋在黃沙之下，它也不會褪色。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……“不會褪色”，是的。就如同你我手中流過的每一顆寶石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，不是河水乾涸，黃沙掩埋了昔日的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而是洪水毀去了那偉大建築的頂端，黃沙深處掩埋的輝煌成了千年的祕密。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_i04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每一次日升月落，都是一個小輪迴的重新演繹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"短暫的一天是如此，漫長的一生是如此……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"城市的枯榮，帝國的盛衰，大地的終始，亦是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，雖然壁畫只能記載下萬古之中的一瞬，但這一瞬同樣會一遍遍輪迴重演，這就是它的價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沙阿命人繪製這些壁畫，並不是為了自己的名在輪迴中留存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他要留下的是他對時間與生命的解釋本身，在那之後，世人便有可以效仿的依據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“過去與未來之王”在此地建設了他的寶庫，於是在他身後漫長的“阿斯蘭戰爭”裡，無數王酋覬覦此地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到極南的熱風讓氣候發生巨變，這裡迎來滔天洪水，城牆傾頹，河流改道，土地變得面目全非。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人們在黃沙中搜尋寶庫的痕跡，卻一無所獲，於是他們開始相信，寶庫已經隨著洪水覆滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"王酋的尋寶隊離開了，工匠和商人們來到這裡，在河邊建起了新的聚落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我始終看著這一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我奉命守護這座寶庫，這是我的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我徘徊在黃沙之中，歷盡日升日落，攔阻那些窺探祕密的不軌之徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而你，年輕人，你應該比任何人都更加確定——沙阿寶庫的本體，就在這座城市的地底。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“第四顆代表肝臟，我們清醒著進入夜晚，為了職責與義務。”……感謝你歸還的寶石，讓我回憶起更多往事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最初，成千上萬的能工巧匠來到一片荒蕪的米納特哈瑪儀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上至奇偉的黃金機關迷宮，下至手工雕琢的源石迴路寶石，工匠們創造了一切，然後將它們埋入黃沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後世的人們大都相信，在耗盡心血的作業之後，所有的工匠也都被埋葬在了他們的造物身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但實際上，仍有一些工匠隱居在米納特哈瑪儀西南的一處村落，世代保守著“寶庫入口在何地”的祕密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該你來說了，年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的事情，便與你的家族有關了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"年輕的監管人緊閉雙目，似乎被沉重的記憶之沙淹沒。\n那段故事經過世代流傳，已經成為高懸於思緒荒漠上空的烈日，仰首便可望見。\n蒸騰著。炙烤著。煎熬著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……三百年前，許多帕夏王酋集結的軍隊找到了那個村子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們向村民們逼問寶庫的入口，堅持守密的人都被砍去了雙手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為不忍村民們繼續受害，一位失去雙手的寶石工匠主動找上王酋軍，提出要為他們引路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在寶庫前，他見證了王酋軍與寶庫守護者的激戰，看到守護者雖然被打敗，但沒有他的法術，寶庫的大門便不會開啟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"憤怒的王酋軍剖開了守護者的胸膛，刮下了他身體內外鑲嵌的每一顆寶石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管那位告密的工匠用盡所知的技術，指導自己年幼的孩子去修復守護者的身軀，但守護者終究沒有醒來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……然後，米納特哈瑪儀的大巴扎立起了一架天平。那個工匠的孩子在成人之後安葬了守護者，又設立了一間寶石交易所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從那以後，他的後人一直在這裡等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一代先祖都竭盡所能，讓米納特哈瑪儀的寶石貿易更加繁榮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百年千年，終有一日，人們能淘盡薩爾貢的黃沙，寶石匯聚在這座城市……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕爾","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我能夠將它們還給您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"感覺到叉鈴抵上胸膛，監管人不敢睜開雙眼。\n但在他的眼前，卻彷彿有數百年的時光在瞬間流淌而過。\n日升月落，物換星移。監管人看到一座座城市興榮，復又消亡，眼前的建築緩慢地化為沙礫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_i09_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"監管人看到一位古老的守護者行走在無邊際的沙漠中。\n守護者張開雙臂，沐浴在繁星的光芒之下，面向東方等待著日出。\n感知到有人在看自己，他垂下視線迎向監管人的目光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_i09_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"在守護者悲憫的注視中，監管人不禁顫抖。\n為他即將吐露的話語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……多麼漫長的時光啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們自由了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見了，二位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去數百年，我有失於自己的職責，但如今我已重返人世，我將與這座城市一起，贖還我們欠下的時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與此同時，我還有一個請求，希望二位能夠答應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那位夢魘當真是哈蘭杜汗的後裔，我將應沙阿之諾，為她打開寶庫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃奧，請確認她的血脈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交由我便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我仍然需要對她進行一番考驗，若她最終無法走上天途，注定不算是合格的夢魘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，讓她踏出那一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會也要一起去吧？我對那些夢魘可沒有什麼好感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們中的酒鬼含量實在是太高了，把酒灑得到處都是，我可不想費力再去舔自己的皮毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，米奧，您需要幫我完成另外一項事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我陷入沉睡之後，沙阿的寶庫遭受了如此嚴重的破壞，這是我的失職。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不得不承認，即使有構裝體在旁協助，我的力量也無法與王酋帕夏集結的軍隊相抗衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我你的決定，我會為你做到，一如既往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我遇到了一個孩子，我覺得她能幫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她追尋著沙阿離去的足跡，找到了我流失在外的寶石，沒有她我無法甦醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你是說那個孩子嗎？我見過她，很不錯的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上進，活潑，就是有些執拗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我想起了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，當我尋回自己的記憶後，那女孩的行為舉止都令我感到熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一如當年，我與姐姐漫步在黃金之城的街巷中，那裡的一磚一瓦，她都清楚它們的來由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對那些上了年頭的東西，她總是格外著迷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要那女孩為你做什麼，祖拜爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要一個同伴，與我共同等候沙阿的歸來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米奧，請為我確認，她是否合格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，祖拜爾，如果那是你的願望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
